OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners' ire over 'forever'
OL,4,Aroadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have complained that it
OL,7,Ffeels like a Surrey road project is
OL,8,F"going to go on forever".
OL,10,FWork on the A320 near Ottershaw
OL,11,FRoundabout in the Chertsey area began
OL,12,Fearlier this year but was halted in
OL,13,FMay.
OL,15,FBob Oliver from the Ottershaw
OL,16,FNeighbourhood Forum claimed works had
OL,17,Fbreached multiple planning conditions,
OL,18,Fincluding the destruction of a wooded
OL,19,Farea that left behind a "wasteland".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
